OL,3,GNEWSA'I became a mounted police
OL,4,Avolunteer after fatal car crash'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has revealed how the death of
OL,7,Fher mother-in-law in a crash inspired
OL,8,Fher to join a new mounted police unit.
OL,10,FEmily Thomas is one of 16 volunteers
OL,11,Fwho work with Warwickshire Police to
OL,12,Fhelp combat rural crime.
OL,14,FWhen applications went out at the
OL,15,Fbeginning of the year, she said she
OL,16,Fknew it was a way of giving back after
OL,17,Fthe support she received from police
OL,18,Fofficers.
